Recipe, spec, workflow


Show code
mars_recipe &lt;- make_recipe(train)

mars_spec &lt;- mars(
  num_terms   = tune(),
  prod_degree = tune()
) |&gt;
  set_engine("earth") |&gt;
  set_mode("regression")

mars_wf &lt;- workflow() |&gt;
  add_recipe(mars_recipe) |&gt;
  add_model(mars_spec)

